'''Stoke-on-Trent Central''' is a [[List of United Kingdom Parliament constituencies|constituency]] in [[Staffordshire]]. It was represented by [[Jo Gideon]] of the [[Conservative Party (UK)|Conservative Party]] from the [[2019 United Kingdom general election|general election of 2019]], who announced in early 2023 that she would not be seeking reelection and accordingly left office at the dissolution of that parliament.

