{{Infobox person|name=Jack Brereton MP|image=File:Official portrait of Jack Brereton crop 2.jpg|caption=Jack Brereton, MP for Stoke-on-Trent South since 2017|alt=Jack Brereton - MP for Stoke-on-Trent South since 2017
